Ring The Pen — required attributions
===================================

Retrosheet
----------
The information used here was obtained free of charge from and is copyrighted
by Retrosheet. Interested parties may contact Retrosheet at
20 Sunset Rd., Newark, DE 19711.

Retrosheet data is historical and delayed. It is never served or described as
live. Raw Retrosheet bulk inputs are not redistributed in this repository; only
small derived artifacts with provenance are committed, and the attribution
above is carried with them.

The 2025 inputs pinned for the historical demo (Phase H) are:
  2025eve/          2025 regular-season event files (.EVA/.EVN)
  2025box/          2025 box/roster files (.EBA/.EBN/.ROS)
  2025plays/        2025 play-by-play CSV
  2025_RE24_Values.csv  2025 run-expectancy (RE24) values
See data/manifest.json for revisions and SHA-256 digests.

Chadwick
--------
bevent.exe and bgame.exe are Chadwick Baseball Bureau tools, used (if at all) to
parse Retrosheet event files. They are not Retrosheet data and are covered by
Chadwick's own license; Linux execution is unverified (see ROADMAP DEC-4).

MLB Stats API
-------------
No MLB Stats API ("Stats API") live feed is redistributed by this repository.
Use of the live feed is limited to individual, non-commercial, non-bulk use and
is not exposed publicly before gate D6 clears in writing. See docs/PRD.md.
